---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Ramp Up History"
  description="How Ramp Up started as a family side project and grew into a mobile youth skateboarding program across Greater Lancaster, PA."
>
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">About &rsaquo; Ramp Up History</p>
      <h1>It started with a question: do we even need a skate shop?</h1>

      <p>
        Christine and Mike have been married for 11 years, and in business
        together for longer. In 2022, looking to shake things up, Christine
        suggested that we &ldquo;quit our jobs and open a skate shop in
        town.&rdquo; The motivation was to become more connected with our
        community and to take control of our destiny. Unfortunately, a
        cursory investigation made it clear that the success rate for
        brick-and-mortar skate shops is criminally low.
      </p>

      <p>
        Around the same time, Mike was managing a side project, PA
        Skateparks &mdash; visiting and cataloging 60+ skateparks across
        Pennsylvania. In the process, he noticed two things within
        skateboarding that appeared sustainable, even growing: building
        concrete parks, and teaching kids. Neither of us knows anything about
        construction. Fortunately, youth programming was right in our
        wheelhouse.
      </p>

      <p>
        The lightbulb moment came when Christine suggested that maybe we
        didn&rsquo;t need a physical skatepark to get started &mdash; at
        least not at first. What if we could prove the concept out of the
        back of a van?
      </p>

      <h2>Growth so far</h2>
      <div class="grid cols-3">
        <div class="card stat">
          <span class="stat-number">90</span>
          <span class="stat-label">skaters served in 2023</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card stat">
          <span class="stat-number">250+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">skaters served in 2024</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card stat">
          <span class="stat-number">400+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">skaters served in 2025</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        Ramp Up has enjoyed steady growth from that moment forward. Our
        ambitions are epic, and we&rsquo;re just getting started &mdash;
        <a href="/programs">new sessions and locations</a> keep opening up as
        the movement grows.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a class="button primary" href="/about/team">Meet the team &rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .stat {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .stat-label {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
